      "content": "i get that, but it's not really about \"mental health\" or being sad. it's just the logic of it. like, if you knew for a fact that your house was going to burn down in a week, why would you bother cleaning it or fixing the roof? it just feels like we're all just delaying the inevitable and wasting energy on things that don't matter anymore.",
